      "message": "I guess it can, with net_device and phy_device structs updated in GKI. Was just following the same process as it was for adding VLANs. Someone from Google suggested building it in, and also there is not a single GKI module in gki_defconfig.\n\nI\u0027ve updated the change, realizing there was no need to update the symbol list.",
