      "writtenOn": "2022-03-17T14:04:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Modules are for devices to enable, not GKI (although we can have GKI modules.)\n\nWhat prevents you from just enabling this option for your device and not touching the GKI kernel at all?",
      "parentUuid": "869d7dad_83048218",
      "revId": "65d55de3f43c71453ec590307f88818d24f6e357",
