        "id": 1907384
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-03-17T14:15:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This block from include/linux/netdevice.h:\n\nstruct net_device {\n...\n#if IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_MACSEC)\n\t/* MACsec management functions */\n\tconst struct macsec_ops *macsec_ops;\n#endif\n...\n}\n\nWhen enabled or build as a module that changes struct net_device adding a field, shifting the fields below and changing the CRC.\n\nIf compiled separately as a modules, it can\u0027t be loaded into a kernel, that was built without CONFIG_MACSEC.",
      "parentUuid": "9cd729bf_09025bf2",
      "revId": "65d55de3f43c71453ec590307f88818d24f6e357",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
