      "writtenOn": "2022-03-17T14:20:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah, ok, that\u0027s a good reason to enable it.\n\nWe can do so, just submit a commit that adds the new value, and when we are able to update the abi (every other week or so), that can happen.  See the gki newsletter for details on how to do this.\n\nSo no need for the .xml update here.",
      "parentUuid": "510a894c_d8cc2a58",
      "revId": "65d55de3f43c71453ec590307f88818d24f6e357",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
